module BUG_RENAME_APP_HEAD.

> Regression fixture for application heads shared by a quantifier binder and
> a nullary list rule. The body [xs 1] must index the bound list, not call the
> outer rule. Variables and rules now occupy disjoint SMT namespaces, so the
> emitted native quantifier cannot shadow the rule symbol. The companion tests
> check that list indexing still uses a fallback and the SMT stays valid.

xs => [Nat0].
p a: Nat0 => Bool.

---

all xs: [Nat0] | #xs > 0 and p (xs 1).
